# sapintegrationsuite_access_policy_runtime_assignments (Data Source)

Lists the runtimes an access policy is replicated to (Cloud Integration runtime, Integration
Cell, Edge Integration Cells) and the transfer status, errors and last status change SAP reports
for each. This is the data behind the Runtimes column of the Access Policies screen. Choosing
the runtimes remains a UI step.

**Status:** unofficial. Needs `enable_unofficial = true`. The runtime assignments are known from
the Security Content service's `$metadata` and were read on a tenant, but SAP does not document
them.

If the object does not exist, the plan fails with SAP's `404`.

